@startuml
title Iceberg 两个 Writer 的乐观并发提交

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #475569
  LifeLineBorderColor #64748B
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  ParticipantBorderColor #334155
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #E0F2FE
}

participant "Writer A" as a
participant "对象存储 / HDFS" as store
participant "Catalog\nmetadata pointer" as catalog
participant "Writer B" as b

a -> catalog : 读取 base metadata v10
catalog --> a : v10
b -> catalog : 读取 base metadata v10
catalog --> b : v10

a -> store : 写 data / manifest / metadata v11-A
b -> store : 写 data / manifest / metadata v11-B

a -> catalog : CAS: v10 -> v11-A
catalog --> a : SUCCESS
b -> catalog : CAS: v10 -> v11-B
catalog --> b : CommitFailedException

b -> catalog : refresh 当前 metadata
catalog --> b : v11-A
b -> b : 在新 base 上重新验证并 apply
b -> store : 复用 data/manifest，写新 manifest list 与 v12-B
b -> catalog : CAS: v11-A -> v12-B
catalog --> b : SUCCESS

note over store,catalog
  文件先写入；只有 catalog pointer 切换成功，
  新 snapshot 才对 reader 可见
end note

note over catalog,b
  网络异常可能让结果变成 UNKNOWN；
  先查 current / previous metadata，不能盲目重试或删文件
end note
@enduml
